cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use PhosKinTime-Vis in your research, please cite it using this metadata.
title: "PhosKinTime-Vis: offline viewer and run comparison for PhosKinTime run bundles"
abstract: >-
  PhosKinTime-Vis opens PhosKinTime run bundles in the browser, verifies their files, redraws the
  model's plots from the stored data, compares runs and exports publication figures. It works
  offline and uploads nothing.
type: software
